reat finale I haven't looked at the  reactions too much but I'm sure some  people will be disappointed which is  inevitable but when you take chances  like this show does sometimes you're  gonna miss and I don't think they did  that with the finale so I'm curious to  hear what you guys think let me know in  the comments I can't wait to go back and  watch it again I can't wait to take a  little bit of time and go back and  re-watch the series knowing what we know  now I think it'll be a whole different  experience and it's one that I look  forward to if you didn't like it what  didn't you like about it what did you  want to see get answered that they can  get answered what way did you want to  see it go it's hard for me to imagine I  could see people being disappointed that  their theories didn't pay off or  something along those lines but I can't  really see this not being a satisfying  ending for the story that we just  watched so I'd be interested to hear  those opinions as well I think it did a  pretty good job of answering all the big  questions but I guess that doesn't mean  that all those answers would be  satisfying to everyone there's  definitely things I could nitpick that I  didn't like in each of the episodes  there were a few things that threw me  off in the moment but overall I think it  worked fantastically and I know that  people guess at the Eliott we were  watching was the other but it wasn't the  most popular theory by any stretch of  the imagination I wonder how the sci-fi  ending people feel about this a lot of  people really had that idea that it was  going to be a sci-fi that there was  gonna be alternate realities there was  gonna be simulations I wonder how this  sits with that crowd for sure but it had  a little bit of everything and like I  mentioned before I mean this has taken  us to some dark places so it's nice that  there is some hope and some optimism at  the end of the story please like this  video if you enjoyed it please subscribe 